{
  "name": "Enspelled Armor",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Bound into it is one spell of level 8 or lower (Abjuration or Illusion). 6 charges, 1d6 regained at dawn. While wearing the armor, expend 1 charge to cast the spell. <strong>Bind Spell</strong> (once, by the DM or owner): type the spell's name and the module adds a cast activity with the table's save DC and attack bonus (cantrip-1: DC 13 / +5; 2: 13 / +5; 3-4: 15 / +7; 5-6: 17 / +9; 7-8: 18 / +10) and sets the rarity. If your armor isn't a Breastplate, change the base item and its stats on the sheet.</p>",
